{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2187","id":4960774905,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAivEQM8AAAABJ69q-Q","html_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2187","diff_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2187.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2187.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/issues/2187","number":2187,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(ime): keep candidate text in sync with TextView layout","user":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Candidate labels can disappear during accessibility-node inspection when custom drawing uses private text while the framework TextView still has an empty text/Layout. This one-file patch keeps framework text as the single value and synchronizes its Layout before custom sizing and drawing.\n\nAfter investigating review comment 4354993843, `7f909060` simplifies the setter to call `super.setText(charSequence, bufferType)` as its first statement, without a condition. It then unconditionally marks the custom measurement/transform caches dirty and requests layout/redraw. No old-content read or equality guard remains. The parent handles constructor initialization, null and same-content BufferType conversions; the override never touches uninitialized paint caches.\n\nI traced the API21/API35 TextView paths and current label consumers. Ordinary relayout/invalidation requests subsequent traversal, and these consumers do not register synchronous text callbacks that measure/draw during the parent setter. No current-path reason for dirty-before-super was found. This removes the previous equal-content optimization; repeated-assignment performance has not been measured. `super.onMeasure` remains for framework Layout/accessibility; the extra `super.onLayout` forwarding remains removed.\n\nValidation:\n\n- HOST Kotlin 2.3.21 / JVM11 compilation with `-Werror` succeeds with empty stderr; bytecode confirms the parent setter precedes custom flag writes and that the setter has no content-comparison branch.\n- [Upstream PR CI](https://github.com/osfans/trime/actions/runs/39889136561) succeeds in all 5 jobs, including actual application test and Lint tasks. No JUnit XML is exported, so no new exact testcase count is claimed. Its actual build is synthetic merge `9ff9572f`, not fork head `7f909060`; the whole trees differ in 33 paths, while the reviewed AutoScale source is byte-identical. Four original Ubuntu ABI APKs and the parent-first DEX contract are audited.\n- The unchanged original upstream-merge x86_64 APK passes all 13 API21 production-class stages / 39 PNGs: construction/Hanzi/Latin/null/rebind, six immediate equal-content buffer sequences, and selectable/public LINE NEXT/PREVIOUS selection (`0 → 2 → 0`). Text/Layout/nodes/buffer types/glyphs and terminal restoration are independently checked. This is same-class validation in the actual merge, not whole-fork runtime acceptance.\n\n[Investigation and current scoped evidence](https://github.com/X2M7/trime/tree/748af2a46a23e01559e9700d5d8c1f8961eecbc0/doc/contribution-split/checks/candidate-setter-order-20261023) are outside the one-file application patch. Fork push validation did not start, and an explicit dispatch was rejected with “Actions has been disabled for this repository”; previous-head JVM/CI/device results are historical. Current validation does not establish TalkBack-service, native candidate activation, physical-device, Release, upgrade or performance acceptance. Observed dependency/toolchain/runtime/signature warnings remain; no zero-warning claim.\n","created_at":"2026-10-22T01:37:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:44:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9ff9572f2ed289d8af198f81ce08bdac66d8a69c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2187/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2187/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/issues/2187/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/statuses/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710","head":{"label":"X2M7:contrib/pr-candidate-text-layout","ref":"contrib/pr-candidate-text-layout","sha":"7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710","user":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.githu